WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.765 --> 00:00:08.316
Hi, there! I'm Mark Drager, and my One-Minute Monday is to embrace competition.

00:00:08.316 --> 00:00:11.211
So, I was speaking to a friend who told me that he came up with a great idea,

00:00:11.211 --> 00:00:15.765
then went online to see who else had done it, and seen that a ton of other people have already done it.

00:00:15.765 --> 00:00:18.732
He got discouraged and thought: "no, that can't be a good idea."

00:00:18.732 --> 00:00:21.735
I say that if you're going to go into a marketplace where there's no one else doing it,

00:00:21.735 --> 00:00:25.564
you are either the smartest person or you're doing something that may not work.

00:00:25.564 --> 00:00:29.876
The better thing to do is to embrace competition, understand that you can go into a competitive...

00:00:29.876 --> 00:00:32.697
marketplace and do it better than anyone else.

00:00:32.697 --> 00:00:37.530
Learn what they're doing wrong, go in there and do it better that anyone else is doing it;

00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:41.663
and if you become a market leader, embrace competition, because you can't just lay back...

00:00:41.663 --> 00:00:43.168
and do nothing.

00:00:43.168 --> 00:00:46.996
You need to look at what other people are doing and continually get better and better and better.

00:00:46.996 --> 00:00:49.519
So, if you're going to go out there, if you're looking for a business idea,

00:00:49.519 --> 00:00:53.199
don't just wait to come up with an idea that no one else has come up with.

00:00:53.199 --> 00:00:57.587
Look at what you're passionate about, look at what the other people are doing, and make sure that...

00:00:57.587 --> 00:00:59.657
you're doing it to the best of your abilities.

00:00:59.657 --> 00:01:01.068
Believe!

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:09.000
